  task_description = """                                                        
  Analyze the provided npz trajectory data to identify the parameters of a      
  bouncing ball system.                                                         
  The system has two variables: x1 (position) and x2 (velocity).                
  1. Calculate the acceleration (dx2/dt) during the flight phases to find the   
